            <tr style="height:66.6500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">The course will be delivered through a combination of the following methods:</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Lecture and Homework</strong>: Core concepts will be introduced through lectures, and understanding will be reinforced through assigned homework.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Q&A</strong>: Dedicated time for students to ask questions and receive answers to clarify concepts.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Discussion</strong>: In-class discussions will be used to explore complex topics and theorems.</span></li>
</ol>
<p>本课程将通过以下方式结合进行教学：</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>课堂讲授与课后作业</strong>: 通过课堂讲授介绍核心概念，并利用课后作业巩固知识。</li>
<li><strong>提问与解答</strong>: 安排专门的问答环节，以便学生提问并获得解答，澄清疑点。</li>
<li><strong>课堂讨论</strong>: 通过课堂讨论来深入探究复杂的知识点和定理。</li>
</ol></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 1:</strong> Historic problems in Calculus; introduction to calculus (differentiation, integration); Chapter 1 (Sections 1.1-1.6): Functions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 2:</strong> Review of Chapter 1; Chapter 2 (Section 2.1).</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 3:</strong> Chapter 2 (Sections 2.2-2.5): Limit of a function; calculating limits using the limit laws; precise definition of a limit; Continuity.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 4:</strong> National Holiday.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 5:</strong> Chapter 2 (Sections 2.6-2.8): Limits at infinity; derivatives and rates of change; the derivative as a function.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 6:</strong> Review of Chapter 2; Chapter 3 (Sections 3.1-3.3): Product and quotient rules; derivatives of trigonometric functions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 7:</strong> Chapter 3 (Sections 3.4-3.5): The Chain Rule; derivatives of logarithmic functions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 8:</strong> Chapter 3 (Sections 3.6-3.9): Implicit differentiation; related rates.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 9:</strong> Chapter 3 (Section 3.10): Linear approximations and differentials; <strong>Mid-term Exam</strong>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 10:</strong> Chapter 4 (Sections 4.1-4.2): Maximum and minimum values; the Mean Value Theorem.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 11:</strong> Chapter 4 (Sections 4.3-4.4): How derivatives affect the shape of a graph; L’Hôpital's Rule.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 12:</strong> Chapter 4 (Sections 4.5, 4.7): Curve sketching; optimization problems.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 13:</strong> Chapter 4 (Sections 4.8-4.9): Newton’s method; antiderivatives.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 14:</strong> Review of Chapter 4; Chapter 5 (Sections 5.1-5.2): The area and distance problem; the definite integral.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 15:</strong> Chapter 5 (Sections 5.3-5.4): The Fundamental Theorem of Calculus; indefinite integrals.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 16:</strong> Substitution Rule; review of Chapter 5; final-exam review.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 17:</strong> Answering questions; administering the <strong>Final Exam</strong>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>Week 18:</strong> Grading exams and submitting scores.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>第一周</strong>: 微积分的历史问题；微积分简介（微分、积分）；第一章 (1.1-1.6节): 函数。</p>
<p><strong>第二周</strong>: 复习第一章；第二章 (2.1节)。</p>
<p><strong>第三周</strong>: 第二章 (2.2-2.5节): 函数的极限；使用极限法则计算极限；极限的精确定义；连续性。</p>
<p><strong>第四周</strong>: 国庆假期。</p>
<p><strong>第五周</strong>: 第二章 (2.6-2.8节): 无穷远处的极限；导数与变化率；作为函数的导数。</p>
<p><strong>第六周</strong>: 复习第二章；第三章 (3.1-3.3节): 乘法与除法法则；三角函数的导数。</p>
<p><strong>第七周</strong>: 第三章 (3.4-3.5节): 链式法则；对数函数的导数。</p>
<p><strong>第八周</strong>: 第三章 (3.6-3.9节): 隐函数微分；相关变率。</p>
<p><strong>第九周</strong>: 第三章 (3.10节): 线性近似与微分；<strong>期中考试</strong>。</p>
<p><strong>第十周</strong>: 第四章 (4.1-4.2节): 最大值与最小值；中值定理。</p>
<p><strong>第十一周</strong>: 第四章 (4.3-4.4节): 导数如何影响函数图像；洛必达法则。</p>
<p><strong>第十二周</strong>: 第四章 (4.5, 4.7节): 函数图像的绘制；最优化问题。</p>
<p><strong>第十三周</strong>: 第四章 (4.8-4.9节): 牛顿法；反导数。</p>
<p><strong>第十四周</strong>: 复习第四章；第五章 (5.1-5.2节): 面积与距离问题；定积分。</p>
<p><strong>第十五周</strong>: 第五章 (5.3-5.4节): 微积分基本定理；不定积分。</p>
<p><strong>第十六周</strong>: 换元积分法；复习第五章；期末总复习。</p>
<p><strong>第十七周</strong>: 答疑与<strong>期末考试</strong>。</p>
<p><strong>第十八周</strong>: 批改试卷与提交成绩。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
